msgid ""
"Add the anchor to `clang/include/clang/ScalableStaticAnalysis/"
"BuiltinAnchorSources.def` (in alphabetical order)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/developer-docs/HowToExtend.md:167
msgid ""
"Add the source files to the `clangScalableStaticAnalysisCore` CMake library "
